<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="page-intro">Last updated: October 2026</p>

<p>This policy covers the OAuth application "Hermes Agent" (owned by Dinesh Weerapura, xydinesh.com) used for personal automation of Gmail, Google Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets and Docs.</p>

<h2>What data is accessed</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Gmail messages (read, send, modify)</li>
  <li>Calendar events</li>
  <li>Drive files</li>
  <li>Contacts (read only)</li>
  <li>Google Sheets and Docs (read/write)</li>
</ul>

<h2>How data is used and stored</h2>
<p>Data is accessed only by the owner's own local automation tooling, running on hardware personally controlled by Dinesh Weerapura. No data is sold, shared with third parties, used for advertising, or used to train AI/ML models. OAuth tokens are stored locally and are never transmitted off that machine except to Google's own API endpoints.</p>

<h2>Data retention and deletion</h2>
<p>No personal data is retained on any server owned or operated by this application. You can revoke access at any time via your Google Account security settings (myaccount.google.com → Security → Third-party apps), which immediately invalidates all tokens.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For any questions about this policy, contact me via the contact details on this site.</p>
